2026-07-18  Gavin Smith <gavinsmith0123@gmail.com>

	Remove check of SA_NOCLDSTOP
	
	* info/signals.c (initialize_info_signal_handler):
	Use #ifdef HAVE_SIGACTION instead of #ifdef SA_NOCLDSTOP.
	* info/signals.h: Remove check of SA_NOCLDSTOP from condition.
	
	The use of SA_NOCLDSTOP was introduced on 2004-03-27 for
	the benefit of Solaris 7, which is likely no longer a relevant
	system to support.
	signals.h had a comment referencing "sort.c" in the coreutils
	sources, but recent coreutils sources do not check SA_NOCLDSTOP
	any more (likely since change on 2025-11-22).

