2026-04-26  Gavin Smith <gavinsmith0123@gmail.com>

	Index sort key output for UTF-8

	* doc/texinfo.tex (\unicodechardefs):
	Use \DeclareUnicodeCharacterSK instead of \DeclareUnicodeCharacter
